darwin openai-compatible session loopback unknown Workbench.Commands.Loopback on macOS allows binds and inbound connections on every local interface; a server bound to 0.0.0.0 or a LAN address may be reachable from other machines; outbound off-machine traffic stays refused, proved before launch
darwin openai-compatible session loopback_local_only unsupported loopback_local_only_unenforceable: Seatbelt network filters accept only * or localhost hosts, and localhost admits binds and inbound connections on every local interface (owner-run evidence); local-only loopback cannot be enforced on macOS
