windows openai-compatible session tool_images unsupported not offered by this engine
windows openai-compatible session tools composed the library calls the caller's handler directly, one call at a time
windows openai-compatible session workspace_read composed the library's read_file, list_files and search_files: regular, singly linked files reached inside WorkDir on WorkDir's own mount
windows openai-compatible session workspace_write composed the library's write_file and edit_file, inside WorkDir on WorkDir's own mount; .git is never written; symlinks are refused, not written through; each write is an atomic, synced replacement; not directory-synced; new files inherit the directory ACL
